1
00:00:03,260 --> 00:00:04,460
Hi,you guys.
我來了

2
00:00:04,700 --> 00:00:06,190
What's the matter?
怎麼了？

3
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:09,390
Well,it's just.. It's one of these situations that I just hate.
又是那種很討厭的狀況

4
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:12,070
A massage client gave me three tickets...
有一個客人給我三張票 

5
00:00:12,270 --> 00:00:14,940
to the Helmut Peltz Exhibit at the Morgan Chase Museum.
去摩根卻斯博物館看展覽

6
00:00:15,240 --> 00:00:17,800
Now you're thinking you gotta sleep with him.
你覺得你得跟他上床

7
00:00:18,510 --> 00:00:22,570
No. No. It's just that he gave me three tickets and there are six of us.
不是，他給我三張票 但是我們有六個人

8
00:00:22,820 --> 00:00:24,980
-I'll give up my ticket. -Me too.
我棄權 我也是

9
00:00:25,950 --> 00:00:27,320
Okay. That's so generous.
你們真大方 

10
00:00:27,520 --> 00:00:29,750
And I think Ross is generous too.
羅斯應該也很大方

11
00:00:30,960 --> 00:00:32,930
Great! Then it's just us girls.
太好了，那我們女生自己去 

12
00:00:33,130 --> 00:00:34,560
-Great. -Yeah.
太好了

13
00:00:35,800 --> 00:00:37,360
So what is the exhibit?
是什麼展覽？

14
00:00:37,570 --> 00:00:40,190
It's mostly just photographs...
主要是...

15
00:00:40,370 --> 00:00:45,360
of lesbian love scenes interspersed with video games and free sandwiches.
女同志性愛攝影展 還可以打電動，吃免費三明治

16
00:00:49,040 --> 00:00:50,310
Oh,man!
討厭啦

17
00:00:54,480 --> 00:00:56,250
-Hi. -Hi.

18
00:00:56,450 --> 00:00:57,540
Hey,Ross,listen.
羅斯

19
00:00:57,750 --> 00:01:01,880
Chandler got you out of going to the lesbian sandwich museum this weekend.
錢德說你週末 不想去女同志三明治博物館

20
00:01:03,390 --> 00:01:08,450
Thanks,but I have plans. Elizabeth and I are going out of town.
謝謝，我有節目了 伊麗莎白和我要出城去

21
00:01:08,660 --> 00:01:09,990
-That's great! -Yeah.
太好了

22
00:01:10,170 --> 00:01:12,430
Think about all the money that you're gonna make.
你可以大賺一筆

23
00:01:12,630 --> 00:01:13,620
Why? What?
什麼意思？

24
00:01:13,840 --> 00:01:16,740
Well,her father pays you for babysitting,right?
是她爸找你去當保姆對吧？

25
00:01:18,240 --> 00:01:21,070
That's funny. But maybe it's time to move on.
真好笑，但你們也該有所長進 

26
00:01:21,280 --> 00:01:23,240
You know,let it go. Stop it!
別再鬧了

27
00:01:23,810 --> 00:01:26,370
Besides,Rachel's going out with Elizabeth's father...
況且瑞秋在和她爸交往 

28
00:01:26,580 --> 00:01:29,480
so he's much older than she is.
而他比她大多了

29
00:01:29,880 --> 00:01:33,980
Looks like I'm not the only one interested in fossils.
看來不只是我對化石有興趣

30
00:01:35,560 --> 00:01:39,390
All that does is remind us that you're interested in fossils.
這種話只會提醒我們 你對化石有興趣

31
00:01:41,130 --> 00:01:42,360
Okay,okay.
好吧

32
00:01:42,560 --> 00:01:47,560
Rachel's gonna need to yell sweet nothings in his ear.
瑞秋想和他甜言蜜語 可得用吼的

33
00:01:51,840 --> 00:01:54,270
-Ross? -Come on! That's funny.
羅斯 拜託，這句很好笑啊

34
00:01:54,480 --> 00:01:57,170
Because he's gonna.. He's got,like,a hearing aid.
因為他戴助聽器，因為…

35
00:01:58,750 --> 00:02:00,870
Because he's all old.
因為他很老

36
00:02:08,320 --> 00:02:10,350
One second.
失陪一下

37
00:02:11,230 --> 00:02:12,850
Okay,look,Ross.
聽著，羅斯

38
00:02:14,160 --> 00:02:16,650
Just so you know, since Lizzie likes you so much...
因為麗莎很喜歡你 

39
00:02:16,830 --> 00:02:19,230
I've accepted the fact that you're dating her.
我決定接受你們交往的事

40
00:02:19,430 --> 00:02:21,060
Really? That's great.
真的？太好了 是啊

41
00:02:21,500 --> 00:02:23,490
Yeah,but then I changed my mind.
但後來我又反悔了 

42
00:02:24,070 --> 00:02:26,400
I'm funny like that.
我就是這麼善變

43
00:02:27,080 --> 00:02:28,940
So I told Lizzie,now I'm telling you.
我已經告訴她，現在我告訴你 

44
00:02:29,140 --> 00:02:31,610
I don't want you seeing my daughter anymore.
我不希望你再和我女兒見面

45
00:02:31,810 --> 00:02:34,110
Look,I realize it upsets you.
好，我知道你很不高興 

46
00:02:34,320 --> 00:02:36,040
Yes,it does.
沒錯

47
00:02:37,620 --> 00:02:40,680
But Elizabeth and I are both adults...
但伊麗莎白和我都是成年人

48
00:02:40,890 --> 00:02:44,720
so I don't think there's anything you can do about it.
所以你也莫可奈何

49
00:02:44,890 --> 00:02:47,760
I'll tell the university about your relationship and have you fired.
我會告訴學校你們在交往 讓你被開除

50
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:50,190
Oh,a man with a plan!
有備而來喔

51
00:02:53,200 --> 00:02:55,360
The One Where Paul's The Man
本集播出：「大逆轉」

00:02:56,200 --> 00:02:57,360
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

52
00:03:30,870 --> 00:03:34,770
This is so exciting. You can get your picture back up on the wall of fame.
好興奮喔 你的照片又要重回名人牆了

53
00:03:34,980 --> 00:03:36,810
He's got all the big actors.
就是啊，這裡什麼大明星都有

54
00:03:36,980 --> 00:03:39,310
It was so cool when I was up there.
之前在牆上時好快樂

55
00:03:39,480 --> 00:03:42,940
Me and Jim Belushi would just be cracking up about something.
我經常和吉姆貝路西說笑

56
00:03:43,320 --> 00:03:46,620
I get fired off Days of Our Lives and he takes me down.
後來我被「我們的歲月」開除 照片被拿下來

57
00:03:46,820 --> 00:03:49,290
Now he's just laughing at me.
現在他都嘲笑我

58
00:03:49,490 --> 00:03:53,360
Look at him. That smug Belushi bastard!
你看那個自鳴得意的混蛋

59
00:03:54,830 --> 00:03:57,860
Okay. Maybe when they put your picture back up...
也許你可以掛在...

61
00:03:58,030 --> 00:03:59,900
they could put you by Matt Lauer.
麥特勞爾旁邊

62
00:04:00,100 --> 00:04:02,540
Look at him just smiling at me.
你看他在對我微笑

63
00:04:04,570 --> 00:04:07,410
Yeah,I know. We'd be great together.
我知道，我們會很速配

64
00:04:11,250 --> 00:04:14,110
-So I'm back. -Who are you?
我回來了 你是誰？

65
00:04:16,220 --> 00:04:17,550
Joey Tribbiani.
喬伊崔比亞尼

66
00:04:18,090 --> 00:04:19,420
From the wall?
我之前上過牆

67
00:04:20,090 --> 00:04:23,060
Okay, maybe this will jog your memory.
也許這樣你會想起來

68
00:04:27,130 --> 00:04:28,120
Okay,anyway.
總之

69
00:04:28,330 --> 00:04:32,060
I'm ready to go back up on the wall. I'm the star of a new TV show.
我可以回牆上了 我主演了一出新戲

70
00:04:33,300 --> 00:04:36,530
-Show me in the TV book. -It's not on TV yet.
哪一出？指給我看  還沒上檔 

71
00:04:36,740 --> 00:04:39,540
Well,then it's not on the wall yet.
那你就還不能上牆

72
00:04:40,510 --> 00:04:44,040
Okay,fine. I will bring you a tape.
好吧，我拿錄影帶給你看

73
00:04:45,210 --> 00:04:48,150
So,now,do you have any of Matt Lauer's clothes?
你手邊有麥特勞爾的衣服嗎？ 

74
00:04:48,350 --> 00:04:51,650
Maybe? Just ones that haven't been cleaned yet?
還沒洗過的？

75
00:04:53,390 --> 00:04:55,120
God.

76
00:04:58,960 --> 00:05:00,260
I love museums.
我好喜歡來博物館 

77
00:05:00,460 --> 00:05:02,760
-Soaking up all the culture. -Yeah.
接受文化熏陶

78
00:05:02,960 --> 00:05:05,690
-Where do you want to start? -The gift shop!
要先去哪裡？ 禮品販賣部 

80
00:05:06,670 --> 00:05:09,730
-And then lunch. -Yes,but I can't eat too much.
然後去吃飯  好，但我不能吃太多 

82
00:05:09,940 --> 00:05:14,240
Paul's taking me out to dinner tonight. He said he has a big surprise planned.
保羅今晚要帶我去吃飯 他說會有個大驚喜

84
00:05:14,540 --> 00:05:17,710
Do you think maybe he's gonna tell you he's gay?
他會不會要說他是同性戀？

85
00:05:18,980 --> 00:05:20,310
What? No,why?
什麼？為什麼？

86
00:05:20,520 --> 00:05:24,180
No reason. That would just be a really big surprise,right?
不為什麼，那樣真的會很驚喜

87
00:05:25,050 --> 00:05:28,450
You could put the aisle over here and have the wedding ceremony over here.
紅毯可以鋪在這邊 然後在這邊證婚

88
00:05:28,660 --> 00:05:30,620
I didn't know you could get married here.
原來這裡可以結婚 

89
00:05:30,830 --> 00:05:33,120
This would be a beautiful place to get married.
這裡當禮堂的確很美

90
00:05:33,290 --> 00:05:36,890
But I wouldn't put the aisle there. And I would never have the ceremony there.
但我不會把紅毯鋪在那邊 更不會在那邊證婚

91
00:05:37,070 --> 00:05:39,190
You'd have the ceremony under a beautiful arch.
應該在這個漂亮的拱門下證婚

92
00:05:39,670 --> 00:05:41,290
May I help you?
有什麼事嗎？

93
00:05:41,740 --> 00:05:44,760
Sorry. Didn't mean to interrupt. It's just such a beautiful space.
抱歉打斷你 這裡很美

94
00:05:44,940 --> 00:05:47,410
-Do you do a lot of weddings? -Yes,we're popular.
經常舉辦婚禮嗎？ 是的，這裡很受歡迎 

95
00:05:47,610 --> 00:05:50,340
There's a two-year waiting list. Sorry.
預約已經排到2年後，抱歉

96
00:05:51,280 --> 00:05:53,840
Monica,you should put your name down for this place.
摩妮卡，你也應該去預約

97
00:05:54,050 --> 00:05:55,780
What? Are you crazy?
什麼？你瘋了嗎？ 

98
00:05:56,150 --> 00:05:58,910
I'm not getting married. I'm not even engaged.
我又不結婚，我甚至還沒訂婚

99
00:05:59,290 --> 00:06:02,480
But there's a two-year wait. What if you get engaged in two years?
但反正要等2年 要是你2年後訂了婚

101
00:06:02,890 --> 00:06:04,880
Then you've got to wait another two years?
還得再等2年

102
00:06:05,090 --> 00:06:07,860
That's four years. Chandler's not gonna wait that long.
那就4年了 錢德才不會等那麼久 

103
00:06:08,060 --> 00:06:10,030
He's gonna find somebody else.
他會去找別人

104
00:06:10,230 --> 00:06:12,630
Someone who did put their name on the list.
某個有預約的人

105
00:06:13,800 --> 00:06:16,030
It can't hurt to put your name down.
先預約又不會怎樣

106
00:06:16,240 --> 00:06:19,930
If,in two years, you're not engaged, you just don't use it.
要是2年後沒訂婚就放棄不用

107
00:06:20,140 --> 00:06:23,010
I guess there is no harm in putting my name down.
先預約的確不會怎樣

108
00:06:23,410 --> 00:06:24,810
I'm gonna do it too.
我也要預約 

109
00:06:25,010 --> 00:06:26,000
Me too!
我也要

110
00:06:26,650 --> 00:06:30,550
-Really? Who would you marry? -I don't have anyone right now.
真的？你要嫁給誰？ 我不知道， 我現在還沒有對象

112
00:06:30,750 --> 00:06:31,810
Oh,Phoebe.
菲比

113
00:06:32,450 --> 00:06:36,480
Don't feel too sorry for me. At least my boyfriend isn't gay.
別為我難過 至少我的男朋友不是同性戀

114
00:06:37,790 --> 00:06:39,160
Phoebe,that's not..
菲比，你根本… 

115
00:06:39,360 --> 00:06:42,260
Don't even get me started on yours.
別逼我批評你家那個

116
00:06:44,670 --> 00:06:47,600
-Did you watch the tape of my show? -I did.
你看過錄影帶了嗎？ 看過了

117
00:06:47,800 --> 00:06:51,530
-Let's get me back up there. -You don't go up on the wall.
好，讓我回牆上吧  不行，你不能上牆

119
00:06:52,810 --> 00:06:57,900
-What? But you saw the show. -lt was very offensive to my people.
什麼？ 但你看過我的戲了  對，它冒犯了我的同胞

121
00:06:59,350 --> 00:07:01,510
Dry cleaners?
乾洗店老闆嗎？

122
00:07:03,180 --> 00:07:06,550
Russians. It showed them as terrorists and villains.
俄國人 它把他們演成恐怖分子和壞蛋

123
00:07:06,750 --> 00:07:10,160
Okay,okay. Look,you got Harrison Ford up there!
好，你看，你有哈里遜福特

124
00:07:10,360 --> 00:07:12,660
That's right. Mr. Ford is a very good customer.
沒錯，福特先生是個好顧客 

125
00:07:12,860 --> 00:07:15,120
He brings us a lot of clothes. You bring nothing!
他帶很多衣服來，你兩手空空

126
00:07:15,530 --> 00:07:16,900
Okay,that may be true.
或許吧

127
00:07:17,100 --> 00:07:21,300
But in Air Force One,okay, the Russians were terrorists and evil!
但在「空軍一號」裡 俄國人是恐怖分子，很邪惡

129
00:07:21,500 --> 00:07:24,940
And plus,he kills a bunch of them. That's offensive to Russians.
他還殺了一堆俄國人 那樣很冒犯你們

130
00:07:25,140 --> 00:07:28,700
-I've never seen it. -You should. It's great!
我沒看過 你應該要看，很贊

132
00:07:33,980 --> 00:07:36,540
This place is really beautiful.
這裡真的好漂亮

133
00:07:36,750 --> 00:07:40,650
I've been coming here since I was a kid. This used to be my grandma's.
對啊，我從小就常來 這裡以前是我奶奶家

134
00:07:40,860 --> 00:07:44,090
The only thing I got from my grandmother was her eyes.
我只遺傳了我奶奶的眼睛

135
00:07:44,560 --> 00:07:47,190
I mean,not her actual eyeballs.
我不是說她的眼珠子

136
00:07:47,400 --> 00:07:50,230
But people say that my eyes look...
大家都說我的眼睛…

137
00:07:50,530 --> 00:07:52,060
Do you wanna make out?
要不要親熱？ 

138
00:07:52,270 --> 00:07:53,790
Sure.
好啊

139
00:07:57,740 --> 00:07:59,000
Are you okay?
你還好嗎？

140
00:07:59,510 --> 00:08:00,670
What's wrong?
怎麼了？

141
00:08:00,880 --> 00:08:04,210
Yeah. I was just thinking about your father.
我只是想到你爸爸

142
00:08:04,410 --> 00:08:06,040
Well,whatever works for you.
只要你能興奮就好

143
00:08:06,250 --> 00:08:07,740
No.
不是

144
00:08:10,750 --> 00:08:14,480
He just really freaked me out before.
他有點把我嚇到了

145
00:08:14,690 --> 00:08:17,990
So we have to hide our relationship from one more person.
我們得再多瞞著一個人 

146
00:08:18,190 --> 00:08:19,250
Big deal.
那又怎樣

147
00:08:19,460 --> 00:08:21,550
Besides,we've had fun hiding it.
況且我們一直很樂在其中

148
00:08:22,060 --> 00:08:23,090
Yeah.
也對

149
00:08:27,270 --> 00:08:29,790
-Yeah? -You brought protection,right?
你有準備防護措施嗎？

150
00:08:30,000 --> 00:08:32,670
Why,are there,like,bears or something?
怎麼了？這裡有熊嗎？

152
00:08:37,510 --> 00:08:41,040
Protection. Yeah. No,yeah. That.. That I forgot.
你是說那個，沒有，我忘了

153
00:08:42,880 --> 00:08:47,250
I can't believe I brought two cans of bug spray and forgot that.
我居然帶了兩瓶防蚊液 卻忘了帶套子

154
00:08:48,290 --> 00:08:52,060
-I'll run to the store and get some. -I'm the guy. I'll get it.
那我去買 不，我是男人，我去買

156
00:08:52,260 --> 00:08:54,850
-Do you know where the store is? -No.
你知道商店在哪裡嗎？ 不知道

157
00:08:55,060 --> 00:08:58,430
Do you wanna ride around town on my little pink bicycle?
你想騎粉紅腳踏車逛大街嗎？

158
00:08:59,070 --> 00:09:01,060
A little bit.
有點想

159
00:09:01,940 --> 00:09:06,670
I'll be back in 10 minutes. Get in the hot tub and I'll meet you there.
我10分鐘後回來 你先進浴缸裡等我

161
00:09:07,210 --> 00:09:08,200
Okay.
好

162
00:09:22,490 --> 00:09:26,520
Oh,my God! What a great surprise! This is such a beautiful house!
天哪，好棒的驚喜 這棟房子好漂亮

163
00:09:26,730 --> 00:09:30,320
Thank you. It used to be my mother's. This is the kitchen.
謝謝，這是我媽的房子 這裡是廚房

164
00:09:34,600 --> 00:09:36,470
-Hey,Chandler. -Hey,Joe.
錢德 喬伊

165
00:09:42,780 --> 00:09:45,640
Everybody's gotta be doing something.
人總得找事情做

166
00:09:49,120 --> 00:09:50,850
You've reached Monica and Chandler's.
這裡是摩妮卡和錢德的家

167
00:09:51,020 --> 00:09:53,850
If you're listening to this message, we're probably screening.
如果你聽到這則留言 我們可能在篩選電話

168
00:09:54,060 --> 00:09:55,280
Yeah,we are.
就是

169
00:09:56,860 --> 00:09:59,380
Hi,this is Hildy from the Morgan Chase Museum.
我是摩根卻斯博物館的海蒂 

170
00:09:59,590 --> 00:10:03,590
I'm calling for Monica Geller. I wanted to let her know that there was a cancellation.
我要找摩妮卡蓋勒 有人取消預約

172
00:10:03,760 --> 00:10:07,830
If she's still interested in having the Bing-Geller wedding in our facility...
如果她還想在我們這裡辦婚禮

173
00:10:08,040 --> 00:10:09,660
...it is available..
現在有空了

174
00:10:10,000 --> 00:10:12,670
This is Chandler Bing! This is Chandler Bing!
我是錢德賓，我是錢德賓

175
00:10:13,340 --> 00:10:14,540
Yes,the groom.
是的，我是新郎

176
00:10:14,740 --> 00:10:16,110
No,not the groom!
不，我不是

177
00:10:20,550 --> 00:10:22,280
It's so secluded up here.
這裡好幽靜

178
00:10:23,050 --> 00:10:25,480
I know. That's why I like it here.
我知道，所以我喜歡這裡

179
00:10:26,790 --> 00:10:29,780
I feel like we're the only two people in the world.
